# Line endings follow .editorconfig: LF everywhere, CRLF for Visual Studio's own files. Fixing them here stops Git's
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and gives every checkout, including CI's, the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.props text eol=crlf
*.targets text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

